Subject: Store ncexhash data as void* instead of uintptr_t
Origin: Filnix
Upstream-Status: Not submitted

NCxcache, NCZarr's chunk cache, keeps node pointers in an ncexhash map
whose data field is a uintptr_t. Under Fil-C an integer carries no
capability, so every pointer read back from the map was unusable and
ncxcachelookup stopped the program (most nczarr_test cases). Make the
data void*; the unit test still stores small integers through casts.

